  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Tip Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Tip</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"bill\">Bill amount ($)</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"bill\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0\" inputmode=\"decimal\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label>Tip percent</label>\n      <div class=\"tip-buttons\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Tip percentage\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"10\">10%</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"15\">15%</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"20\">20%</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"people\">Number of people</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"people\" min=\"1\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" inputmode=\"numeric\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"results\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"result-row\">\n        <span>Tip per person</span>\n        <span id=\"tip-per-person\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"result-row\">\n        <span>Total per person</span>\n        <span id=\"total-per-person\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: #1a1c2c;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: #f4f4f4;\n  padding: 1rem;\n  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 4px);\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #2a2d4a;\n  border: 4px solid #5a5f8a;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 2rem;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f101a;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n  color: #ffd93d;\n  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #0f101a;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  color: #b8b8d4;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"] {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 0.75rem;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  background: #1a1c2c;\n  border: 3px solid #5a5f8a;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  color: #f4f4f4;\n  outline: none;\n  transition: border-color 0.1s;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"]:focus {\n  border-color: #ffd93d;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.3);\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"]:hover {\n  border-color: #7a7faa;\n}\n\n.tip-buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.tip-btn {\n  flex: 1;\n  padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;\n  font-size: 1.125rem;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  background: #3a3f6a;\n  color: #f4f4f4;\n  border: 3px solid #5a5f8a;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.05s;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.tip-btn:hover {\n  background: #4a4f7a;\n  border-color: #7a7faa;\n}\n\n.tip-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #ffd93d;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.tip-btn.active {\n  background: #ffd93d;\n  color: #1a1c2c;\n  border-color: #ffd93d;\n}\n\n.tip-btn:active {\n  transform: scale(0.95);\n}\n\n.results {\n  margin-top: 1.5rem;\n  padding-top: 1.5rem;\n  border-top: 3px dashed #5a5f8a;\n}\n\n.result-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n  font-size: 1.125rem;\n}\n\n.result-row span:first-child {\n  color: #b8b8d4;\n}\n\n.result-row span:last-child {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  color: #ffd93d;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1.25rem;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .tip-btn {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    padding: 0.6rem 0.25rem;\n  }\n  .result-row span:last-child {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  const billInput = document.getElementById('bill');\n  const peopleInput = document.getElementById('people');\n  const tipButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.tip-btn');\n  const tipPerPersonEl = document.getElementById('tip-per-person');\n  const totalPerPersonEl = document.getElementById('total-per-person');\n\n  let selectedTip = 15;\n\n  function formatCurrency(value) {\n    return '$' + value.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  function calculate() {\n    const bill = parseFloat(billInput.value) || 0;\n    const people = parseInt(peopleInput.value, 10) || 1;\n    const validPeople = people > 0 ? people : 1;\n\n    const tipTotal = bill * (selectedTip / 100);\n    const total = bill + tipTotal;\n\n    const tipPerPerson = tipTotal / validPeople;\n    const totalPerPerson = total / validPeople;\n\n    tipPerPersonEl.textContent = formatCurrency(tipPerPerson);\n    totalPerPersonEl.textContent = formatCurrency(totalPerPerson);\n  }\n\n  function setActiveTip(percent) {\n    selectedTip = percent;\n    tipButtons.forEach(btn => {\n      const isActive = parseInt(btn.dataset.tip, 10) === percent;\n      btn.classList.toggle('active', isActive);\n      btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', isActive);\n    });\n    calculate();\n  }\n\n  tipButtons.forEach(btn => {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      setActiveTip(parseInt(btn.dataset.tip, 10));\n    });\n  });\n\n  billInput.addEventListener('input', calculate);\n  peopleInput.addEventListener('input', calculate);\n\n  // Initialize\n  setActiveTip(15);\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Tip Calculator\n\nA simple offline browser app to calculate tip and total per person, with a pixel-art aesthetic.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter the bill amount.\n3. Select a tip percentage (10%, 15%, or 20%). The default is 15%.\n4. Enter the number of people (minimum 1).\n5. The tip per person and total per person are displayed and update automatically.\n\n## Features\n\n- Responsive layout from 360px wide.\n- Keyboard accessible with visible focus states.\n- No external dependencies or network requests.\n- Pixel-art styling using CSS only.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `styles.css` – styling\n- `script.js` – logic\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
}